I got it . We rig an antenna on this , we can shock the hell out of him .

993
01:14:52,807 --> 01:14:54,286
Right ! You 're learning .

994
01:14:54,327 --> 01:14:56,238
( Beating intensifies )

995
01:14:57,567 --> 01:14:59,046
He 's getting closer !

996
01:14:59,087 --> 01:15:03,717
They spend their lives looking for food , they don 't care what it is .

997
01:15:03,767 --> 01:15:06,600
Maybe he 's got indigestion . He 's eaten my plane !

998
01:15:08,567 --> 01:15:10,683
It 's not food he 's after .

999
01:15:10,727 --> 01:15:13,560
Michael , turn on your switch . I need a test .

1000
01:15:13,607 --> 01:15:16,485
- Anybody tell you you 're nuts ? - All the time .

1001
01:15:16,527 --> 01:15:19,485
If it responds to external electrical impulse ,

1002
01:15:19,527 --> 01:15:23,236
it might respond to one inside - confuse him , drive him crazy .

1003
01:15:23,287 --> 01:15:25,926
- ( Electrical whine ) - OK , a test ... Good .

1004
01:15:29,767 --> 01:15:33,476
You 'd better get up here ! The heartbeat 's stopped !

1005
01:15:38,927 --> 01:15:40,519
Shit .

1006
01:15:40,567 --> 01:15:44,082
Either he 's gone or your gear 's crapped out again .

1007
01:15:45,127 --> 01:15:49,359
That 's bull . My equipment don 't crap out . He 'll be back .

1008
01:15:49,407 --> 01:15:52,080
( Jake ) Get me the boat hook .

1009
01:15:52,127 --> 01:15:56,723
( Hoagie ) Maybe he had a heart attack . Humans are full of cholesterol .

1010
01:15:56,767 --> 01:15:58,837
- Give me that . - Shit ! Where is he ?

1011
01:16:00,887 --> 01:16:03,799
Give me that line , Michael . Right there .

1012
01:16:04,847 --> 01:16:06,280
There he is !

1013
01:16:08,127 --> 01:16:10,595
( Hoagie ) Ellen , try the engine .

1014
01:16:11,927 --> 01:16:14,236
Ellen ! Try to start the engine !

1015
01:16:17,527 --> 01:16:18,846
( Engine starts )

1016
01:16:18,887 --> 01:16:21,879
Son of a bitch . Let 's get out of here .

1017
01:16:21,927 --> 01:16:25,966
No , it 's too late , Hoagie . Give me a hard port .

1018
01:16:26,007 --> 01:16:27,725
Right !

1019
01:16:27,767 --> 01:16:32,443
( Michael ) Here , give me that . ( Jake ) No ! No time for that !

1020
01:16:32,487 --> 01:16:35,445
Jake ! You can 't go out there without a line !

1021
01:16:38,087 --> 01:16:40,806
Keep it steady . It 's gonna come back !

1022
01:16:57,487 --> 01:17:00,604
Damn thing 's disappeared . He 's gone !

1023
01:17:27,327 --> 01:17:29,318
( Electronic heartbeat )

1024
01:17:35,887 --> 01:17:42,076
Jake !

1025
01:18:09,087 --> 01:18:12,238
We 're taking too much water . It 'll stop the engine .

1026
01:18:12,287 --> 01:18:15,324
Ellen , take the wheel . We 've got to outrun it . Ellen !

1027
01:18:31,727 --> 01:18:35,402
- That thing gonna work ? - It 'll work .

1028
01:18:35,447 --> 01:18:38,723
If Jake says so , it will . This charge will drive it crazy .

1029
01:19:19,887 --> 01:19:21,479
( High-pitched drone )

1030
01:19:21,527 --> 01:19:22,562
( Roaring )

1031
01:19:25,687 --> 01:19:26,881
( Roaring )

1032
01:19:28,567 --> 01:19:30,683
( Drone turns to patchy static )

1033
01:19:40,087 --> 01:19:43,159
Sweet Jesus , we 're headed straight for it !

1034
01:19:43,207 --> 01:19:45,596
Ellen , come about !

1035
01:19:47,247 --> 01:19:49,044
( Drone resumes )

1036
01:19:50,087 --> 01:19:51,361
( Roaring )

1037
01:19:51,407 --> 01:19:55,002
( Hoagie ) We 're gonna hit it ! Hold on !

1038
01:19:55,047 --> 01:19:56,526
Hold on !

1039
01:19:57,687 --> 01:19:59,882
Smile , you son of a bitch !

1040
01:20:25,327 --> 01:20:26,476
- Michael ! - Come over here .

1041
01:20:30,527 --> 01:20:31,926
Michael !

1042
01:20:31,967 --> 01:20:34,606
It 's all right ! I 'm OK !

1043
01:20:34,647 --> 01:20:37,764
( Man ) Anybody there ? Over here !

1044
01:20:40,967 --> 01:20:42,195
Jake !

1045
01:20:44,727 --> 01:20:47,366
Michael , you got a minute ?

1046
01:20:47,407 --> 01:20:49,841
It 's Jake !

1047
01:20:52,607 --> 01:20:54,563
Son of a bitch !

1048
01:21:05,047 --> 01:21:06,878
Jesus , Jake .

1049
01:21:10,327 --> 01:21:14,002
What took you so damn long , man ?

1050
01:21:14,047 --> 01:21:16,436
What the hell are you doing alive ?

1051
01:21:16,487 --> 01:21:20,196
I told you Uncle Jake 's equipment don 't crap out , eh ?

1052
01:21:22,927 --> 01:21:26,806
You 're not going to do something stupid like die on me , are you ?

1053
01:21:26,847 --> 01:21:30,362
No , man . I 'm way too mean for that .

1054
01:21:37,247 --> 01:21:40,319
So from now on , we 're going to study snails , eh ?

1055
01:21:40,367 --> 01:21:41,959
Yeah .

1056
01:21:46,487 --> 01:21:48,876
( Ellen ) Come to Amity this summer .

1057
01:21:48,927 --> 01:21:51,999
( Carla ) We 'll be there . ( Ellen ) You make sure they come .

1058
01:21:52,047 --> 01:21:54,641
( Thea ) I will . I 'll miss you , Grandma .

1059
01:21:56,327 --> 01:21:59,239
Get in , Ellen Brody . You 'll miss your plane .

1060
01:21:59,287 --> 01:22:01,755
- Goodbye , Grandma ! - OK .

1061
01:22:01,847 --> 01:22:04,122
- Be careful . - OK . See ya .

1062
01:22:05,207 --> 01:22:07,562
- Take good care of Jake . - I will .

1063
01:22:09,007 --> 01:22:11,567
You gonna be OK ?

1064
01:22:11,607 --> 01:22:14,599
- Yeah . - OK .

1065
01:22:15,407 --> 01:22:19,036
When I come back , remind me to tell you about the time

1066
01:22:19,087 --> 01:22:21,317
I took a hundred nuns to Nairobi .

1067
01:22:26,807 --> 01:22:30,436
( Hoagie ) There they were , 100 nuns , playing guitars

1068
01:22:30,487 --> 01:22:34,400
and singing , ' The hills are alive with the sound of music . '

1069
01:22:34,447 --> 01:22:38,076
Then suddenly , one comes up to me and she says ,

1070
01:22:38,127 --> 01:22:41,085
'There 's smoke coming from the engine . '

1071
01:22:41,127 --> 01:22:43,880
But I never took them seriously ,

1072
01:22:43,927 --> 01:22:46,999
until they all started singing 'Nearer My God to Thee . '

1073
01:26:19,087 --> 01:26:22,124
Ripped by thewildbunch22

